    """
    Data Class for LATERAL VIEW supported by hive and sparksql:

    .. code-block:: sql

        FROM tab LATERAL VIEW explode(tab.col1) alias AS col2

    A lateral view is read like a subquery named alias, whose columns are generated by a table generating function.
